## Create a Class
...
- Create a Class is the Multiplayer loadout system where you build and customize your Operator before entering a match.
- Create a Class has been redesigned for Modern Warfare 4, bringing every major loadout choice together in one streamlined menu.
- Customize your Operator, Primary Weapon, Secondary Weapon, Melee Weapon, Tactical Equipment, Lethal Equipment, Field Upgrade, Perks, and Killstreaks.
- Create up to 12 Custom Loadouts (Classes), each with its own Operator, weapons, equipment, Perks, Field Upgrade, and Killstreaks.
- Assign Operators, Perks, and Killstreaks to individual Custom Loadouts or apply them across all your loadouts.
- Additional customization options unlock as you increase your Player Level throughout the Beta.
