- Join a large-scale ground assault to prevent the destruction of a vital nuclear power station.
- Experience Modern Warfare 4's dramatic cinematic Campaign action using the game's weapons, movement, and combat systems.
- Continue the fight when the full Campaign launches on October 23, or pre-order and play it one week earlier when Campaign Early Access begins on October 16.
